sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Turing wavenumber at 15.49 µm on Aulacopleura koninckii holaspis18 (428.3 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 87.6/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 keeps the same 15.49 µm law (dispersion Pearson r = 0.9948, equal-diffusion ablation max Re sigma = -0.048, repeats 5 < 11 < 14). The growth GIF now paints the rib carrier only on the warm cuticle (R-G above the 70th percentile) instead of a geometric oval. Last-frame CV similarity rose from 86.0 to 92.8. A lateral transect (columns 0.62-0.78) has its own 16-mode Pearson r = 0.9863, beside the midline r = 0.9832. Still one assessor and still no resolved 15 µm lens measurement. Overall 87.6/100 (faithfulness 87.7, reproducibility 87.2); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 88, Morphological realism / specimen match 88, Parameter expressivity 86, Morphometric validation 88, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 84, Reproducibility package 87. Output judged: docs/media/aulacopleura_koninckii_holaspis18_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 1009271 B, 1248×960 px, artifact_sha256 cecd7f1a290fb2a99e863a9f957dce81d24d61962df4b0462021e418e1676a2f (sha256 cecd7f1a290fb2a99e863a9f957dce81d24d61962df4b0462021e418e1676a2f), spec_fingerprint a8d8d68eaa2ce087b7e2a7e143f02ff889326157548ffa190bc5cdb91f8c1ad9. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: a8d8d68eaa2ce087b7e2a7e143f02ff889326157548ffa190bc5cdb91f8c1ad9; artifact_sha256: cecd7f1a290fb2a99e863a9f957dce81d24d61962df4b0462021e418e1676a2f; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/aulacopleura_koninckii_holaspis18_turing_wavelength_s0/aulacopleura_koninckii_holaspis18_specimen.jpg=50ac5dbca8261978..., datasets/aulacopleura_koninckii_holaspis18_turing_wavelength_s0/aulacopleura_koninckii_holaspis18_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=e33257c717547148...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-aulacopleura-koninckii-holaspis18-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Hughes & Chapman 1995 and Fusco et al. 2004: meraspid segment addition and a variable holaspid thoracic number, including 18 segments. | Fusco, Hong & Hughes 2016: axial growth gradients along the trunk. | Turing 1952: reaction-diffusion selects a finite critical wavelength. | Commons File:Aulacopleura konincki.jpg, 14 mm, Silurian, CC BY-SA 3.0.; reconstructed_in_script: Jacobian and D_v/D_u = 40 solved so lambda_c = 15.49 µm = 1.549e-05 m at 428.3 Ma. | Rib-span fraction 0.2245 on the pinned photograph, applied to the meraspis (4.2 mm, 12 segments, 428.5 Ma) and holaspis22 (22 mm, 22 segments, 428.1 Ma) lengths. | Mode counts 5, 11 and 14. Midline rib Pearson r = 0.9832; lateral transect Pearson r = 0.9863. | Cuticle mask from red-minus-green chroma, 70th percentile, largest component.; transfer_boundary: species_gallery meraspis / holaspis18 / holaspis22 JPEGs are byte-identical, so only the Commons photograph is an independent image. | The photograph resolves pleural ribs at hundreds of micrometres. The 15.49 µm wavelength is the cellular-scale law, not a feature counted on the photograph.; does_not_claim: Does not claim a published holochroal lens diameter of 15.49 µm for this species. | Does not claim a second assessor. | Does not claim the chroma mask is a histological outline of the pleurae.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "open need [independent_assessor/model-fidelity, pressure P=1.3]: Single builder-assessor. A second model has not scored this script.",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R3', 'item': 'Independent second assessor (different model) — still builder-scored after pass 2.'}" ;
        pk:hasScore "0.876"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder-assessor, single agent; second assessor not run)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000> .
}

